Thanks for this bug report, @ivanjx!

It looks like this is a bug related to the interceptors rewrite. Both of the route handlers in your application implement the exact same function signature (consume two strings and return a string) so we generate equivalent coegen for the both of them. I believe the issue here is that we should account for the parameter name in for methods that accept route parameters to account for the following codegen:

```csharp
var cameraId_RouteOrQueryResolver = GeneratedRouteBuilderExtensionsCore.ResolveFromRouteOrQuery("cameraId", options.RouteParameterNames);
var indexName_RouteOrQueryResolver = GeneratedRouteBuilderExtensionsCore.ResolveFromRouteOrQuery("indexName", options.RouteParameterNames);
```
